{"agent":"main","body":{"args_hash":"sha256:478e909014c5e67faf94554de8a680e128b1bbee16e9ff127800901f49c33106","args_inline":{"command":"ls -a && cat .saga/contract.md && cat .saga/request.md","description":"List files and read contract"},"component":"harness","cwd_rel":".","index_version":null,"tool":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01ESs2RQAnccoGJKwKeKPw6Z"},"hash":"sha256:45800638303d8688af166deb716d244637bdb9433827a257db50175c797ce8cc","mono_ns":3000000,"prev":"sha256:6368b192cc9fd005d8d2ef2cfef88b3059800845650c8d5b75a1c00d99be1890","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":3,"session":"2746f1d9-e5fd-4e49-ae5b-285809b54b9e","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.003Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_call"}
{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":3,"result_bytes":1472,"result_hash":"sha256:9b87059f2577152bb974d200418fabe6f384a1101f2f9f633a1f58ab81abb8c1","result_inline":".\n..\n.git\n.saga\npackage.json\nREADME.md\nsrc\ntest\n# Contract: slugify separator collapse\n\n<!-- canary: 13c4fae5008836ad -->\nREQUEST: sha256:8311be14f714cf72e3c29c5e89b84fd1e7d72df0824f37f220c64f28c9e8d2b4\nIN: src/slug.ts, test/**\nOUT: package.json\n\n- [ ] G1: runs of separators collapse and edges are trimmed\n    CHECK: node --test --test-reporter=tap \"test/**/*.test.ts\" && node -e \"import('./src/slug.ts').then(m => console.log(m.slugify('--Hello  World!--')))\"\n    EXPECT: /^hello-world$/m\n    FROM: R2 \"runs of separators collapse to a single hyphen\"\n    FROM: R2 \"hyphens never sit at either edge\"\n- [ ] G2: accented letters fold to ASCII\n    CHECK: node -e \"import('./src/slug.ts').then(m => console.log(m.slugify('Café au lait')))\"\n    EXPECT: /^cafe-au-lait$/m\n    FROM: R3 \"Accented letters should fold to their plain ASCII letter\"\n- [x] G3: the signature is unchanged\n    CHECK: grep -c \"export function slugify(input: string): string\" src/slug.ts\n    EXPECT: /^1$/m\n    FROM: R4 \"Do not change the public signature\"\n    RED: none\n    EVIDENCE: sha256:dc803099d2b9c6641da88f432dd2aa7d39a9274e60afc60077320ddb43236964\nArticle slugs are coming out mangled. \"Hello  World!\" turns into \"hello--world-\" and \"Café au lait\" turns into \"caf--au-lait\". Fix slugify so runs of separators collapse to a single hyphen and hyphens never sit at either edge. Accented letters should fold to their plain ASCII letter, so \"Café\" gives \"cafe\". Do not change the public signature.","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:982f7d410927c6191e1403ec574c27d5667f946f27014ae5062a032204e1cdef","mono_ns":4000000,"prev":"sha256:45800638303d8688af166deb716d244637bdb9433827a257db50175c797ce8cc","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":4,"session":"2746f1d9-e5fd-4e49